WEBVTT

00:10:58.036 --> 00:11:00.356
everything after that
are monsters of the trees."

00:11:00.396 --> 00:11:01.556
(Laughter)

00:11:01.596 --> 00:11:05.196
"Because it's just dark and horrible
in there, so let's not do that."

00:11:05.516 --> 00:11:07.596
But that is exactly what we do right now

00:11:07.636 --> 00:11:09.756
to 70 percent of the planet.

00:11:09.756 --> 00:11:11.996
And that's what I find quite frustrating.

00:11:12.396 --> 00:11:15.476
Another question I get asked
sometimes as well is --

00:11:15.476 --> 00:11:17.356
other than the fear stuff,

00:11:17.396 --> 00:11:18.596
and the claustrophobia

00:11:18.596 --> 00:11:20.796
and the toilet question
and stuff like that --

00:11:21.516 --> 00:11:24.356
is, you know, what’s it like being
in the bottom of the sea,

00:11:24.356 --> 00:11:26.276
looking out the window and seeing stuff?

00:11:26.316 --> 00:11:29.876
And I actually find it a genuinely

00:11:29.876 --> 00:11:31.756
difficult question to answer.